CONNECTION_OPTION_1     EQU 11
CONNECTION_OPTION_2     EQU 12
CONNECTION_OPTION_3     EQU 13
CONNECTION_OPTION_4     EQU 14
CONNECTION_OPTION_5     EQU 15
CONNECTION_END          EQU 255

